---
---

<section
  class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50 py-20 px-4 text-center"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="font-serif text-5xl font-extrabold text-stone-800 mb-4">
      Descubra Novas Receitas Semanalmente
    </h2>
    <p class="font-sans text-xl text-stone-600 mb-8">
      Assine nossa newsletter e receba as melhores e mais exclusivas receitas
      direto na sua caixa de entrada, toda semana!
    </p>
    <form class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-4">
      <input
        type="email"
        placeholder="Seu e-mail aqui"
        aria-label="Email para newsletter"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto flex-grow px-6 py-3 rounded-full border-2 border-amber-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 transition duration-300 text-lg text-stone-800 bg-white shadow-md"
      />
      <button
        type="submit"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full shadow-lg transform hover:scale-105 transition duration-300 text-lg"
      >
        Assinar
      </button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>